{
  "id": "noise___maximum_daily_dose_level",
  "title": "Noise - Maximum Daily Dose Level",
  "description": "Calculate daily noise exposure dose and convert to 8-hr Time-Weighted Average (TWA). When exposed to different noise levels throughout the day, this tool computes the cumulative daily dose as a percentage and the corresponding TWA in dB(A). According to NIOSH guidelines, the daily dose should not exceed 100%.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Noise Dose Calculation\n\nWhen exposed to different noise levels throughout a working day, the daily dose can be calculated using:\n\n**D = (te₁/td₁ + te₂/td₂ + ... + teₙ/tdₙ) × 100%**\n\nwhere:\n- **D** = daily noise exposure (%)\n- **te** = exposure time at a specified noise level (min)\n- **td** = maximum duration time at specified noise level (min)\n\nThe Time-Weighted Average (TWA) for an 8-hour shift is then calculated as:\n\n**TWA = 10 log(D/100) + 85**\n\nAccording to NIOSH, the daily dose level should **not exceed 100%**."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "exposure_time_1",
          "label": "Exposure Time 1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "min",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "max_duration_1",
          "label": "Maximum Duration 1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "min",
          "defaultValue": 15
        },
        {
          "id": "exposure_time_2",
          "label": "Exposure Time 2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "min",
          "defaultValue": 30
        },
        {
          "id": "max_duration_2",
          "label": "Maximum Duration 2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "min",
          "defaultValue": 60
        },
        {
          "id": "exposure_time_3",
          "label": "Exposure Time 3",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "min",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "max_duration_3",
          "label": "Maximum Duration 3",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "min",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "daily_dose",
          "label": "Daily Noise Dose",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "((inputs.exposure_time_1 / inputs.max_duration_1) + (inputs.exposure_time_2 / inputs.max_duration_2) + (inputs.exposure_time_3 / inputs.max_duration_3)) * 100"
        },
        {
          "id": "twa",
          "label": "8-hr Time-Weighted Average (TWA)",
          "unit": "dB(A)",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "10 * Math.log10(((inputs.exposure_time_1 / inputs.max_duration_1) + (inputs.exposure_time_2 / inputs.max_duration_2) + (inputs.exposure_time_3 / inputs.max_duration_3)) * 100 / 100) + 85"
        }
      ]
    },
